      "en": "The LORD’s glory came into the house by the way of the gate which faces toward the east.",
      "ko": "여호와의 영광이 동문으로 말미암아 전으로 들어가고",
      "source_text_hash": "505acd5432f4a7e275ad550adbe87176df842d87c604281cde48df9c8de1d3db",
      "translation_text_hash": "120dc00d4839aaf619d02322eaa37a1a6761fc8d62c1ff61ce3e9820bf344db1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와의 영광이 동문으로 말미암아 전으로 들어가고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "120dc00d4839aaf619d02322eaa37a1a6761fc8d62c1ff61ce3e9820bf344db1"
      ]
